  "explanation": "Multiple high-quality sources (D1S1, D2S1, D3S1) explicitly state that 'Lahu Ke Do Rang' (1979) was directed by Mahesh Bhatt. The claim that Raj Kapoor directed the film appears only in D5S1 within a category list ('Films directed by Raj Kapoor') which contradicts the specific director attribution found in the main text of the same source and all other documents. Given the explicit contradiction and the fact that Raj Kapoor is a distinct entity often associated with other films (as seen in D4S7), the assertion regarding Raj Kapoor is treated as an error in the source categorization rather than a valid alternative answer. Therefore, only Mahesh Bhatt is retained."
